  "ruleText": "Ins 1201.17 Statutory Requirements. Failure to include any statutory provision in this part shall not be construed as a waiver of such provision by the commissioner.\n\nSource. #4287, eff 7-1-87; amd by #4369, eff 3-1-88; amd by #5116, eff 7-1-91; ss by #5650, eff 7-1-93, EXPIRED 7-1-99\n\nNew. #7146, eff 4-1-00, EXPIRED: 4-1-08\n\nNew. #9611, eff 1-4-10; ss by #12474, eff 2-2-18",
